WEBVTT

00:28:58.047 --> 00:29:00.640
And I think these mission-led companies

00:29:00.664 --> 00:29:02.957
and companies with great aspirations,

00:29:02.981 --> 00:29:04.184
that is the challenge,

00:29:04.208 --> 00:29:07.529
I think it's part of what gets
your customers to buy into what you do,

00:29:07.553 --> 00:29:10.816
it's part of what get your team
to buy into what you do and to grow.

00:29:10.840 --> 00:29:14.155
But you set the bar
for yourself incredibly high.

00:29:14.653 --> 00:29:17.634
And I think some companies
have been, like, very clear

00:29:17.658 --> 00:29:19.671
and pragmatic about what they do,

00:29:19.695 --> 00:29:22.417
and are able to live that.

00:29:22.441 --> 00:29:25.775
I think Amazon does that pretty well.

00:29:25.799 --> 00:29:27.114
I think that's tricky.

00:29:27.138 --> 00:29:31.423
You know, being able to manage
this aspirational,